{"symbol":"UNIFIED","yahoo":"UNIFIED.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Unified Data- Tech Solutions Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.udtechs.com","about":"Unified Data- Tech Solutions Limited, a technology company, specializes in system integration in India. The company offers comprehensive IT solutions comprising data center infrastructure, such as servers, storage area network (SAN) and network attached storage (NAS) solutions, and networking equipment; networking and security technologies, including firewall and VPN solutions, intrusion detection and prevention system, endpoint security solutions, and network segmentation and access controls; virtualization and private cloud technologies, which consists of server and desktop virtualization, private cloud deployment, and management tools; hybrid cloud design and implementation, and cloud management platforms; secure application delivery, such as application firewalls, load balancing, application mentoring and performance, and secure access solutions; data protection and resiliency technologies, including backup and restore solutions, disaster recovery planning, and high availability solutions; and cybersecurity services. It also provides technology advisory, system integration, expert, and operation management services. The company serves the banking, finance, insurance, manufacturing, pharmaceutical, IT, and IT-enabled services industries. Unified Data- Tech Solutions Limited was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:19:16+00:00","quote":{"price":496.9,"prevClose":526.95,"marketCap":998.28,"high52":535.0,"low52":284.0,"pe":24.49,"bookValue":69.01,"dividendRate":11.0,"roe":34.45,"shares":2.009,"insiders":69.75,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-05-29","2025-05-30","2025-06-02","2025-06-03","2025-06-04","2025-06-05","2025-06-06","2025-06-09","2025-06-10","2025-06-11","2025-06-12","